    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always seen math as practical and useful, especially in everyday tasks like budgeting or understanding data trends. My upper secondary education gave me a solid foundation, and I enjoy applying it to real-world problems through computer science and economics. I don’t find it intimidating but appreciate its logic and structure.",  
